   or offering the Software itself as a product.

   "Derivative Work" means any work that contains, modifies, or directly
   incorporates the Software's source code or substantial portions of it.
   This term applies to code-level adaptation only and does not extend to
   independently written software that addresses similar problems.

   "Personal Use" means use by an individual for private, non-commercial
   purposes, including learning, experimentation, and portfolio review.

